===
+ *uration* of the League of *Nations* will, presumably, be satisfied when Parliament meets, but there is a certain nervousness at the *suggestion* that Mr Lloyd George will go over there as chief of the British *delegation.*

**tipstaff.** Pl. *-affs* or *-aves*.

**tiptoe,** v., is, like *hoe* & *shoe*, an exception to the ^^MUTE E^^ rule, & makes *tiptoeing*.
